{"change_summary":"Confirmed the branch already contains the approved molt/mineral fixes, so this apply-fixes pass was validation-only and required no source edits. I rechecked the named molt parameter wiring, high-mineral diagnostics, and ideal reproduction harness coverage, then reran the focused regressions plus the full `tank_core` suite; all passed on the current branch, including the previously noted `thermal_reproduction_penalty` and `root_zone_oxygenation` coverage.","outstanding_risks":[],"steps":[{"description":"Inspected the current branch for the approved shrimp molt/mineral parameter, event-diagnostic, and harness changes to verify the review-approved fixes were still present before making any edits.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Reran focused regressions for molt/mineral behavior, current-schema stage-timer save/load handling, and the controlled ideal reproduction harness path.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Ran the full `tank_core` suite to confirm broader stability and recorded this stage as validation-only because no further code changes were needed.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`rg -n \"molt_reserve_fraction|critical_molt_gh_ratio|HighMinerals|controlled_ideal_reproduction_path_still_hatches\" crates/tank_core crates/tank_harness crates/tank_scenarios`","`cargo test -p tank_core --test molt_mineral_budget -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_core --test save_load current_schema_roundtrip_preserves_zero_stage_timer_for_newly_added_adults -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_harness controlled_ideal_reproduction_path_still_hatches -- --nocapture`","`cargo test -p tank_core -- --nocapture`"]}